{"id":"fb1c292712c7fb27","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean.md","title":"Second-Box Boolean Preservation Lemma","display":"lem-glb-second-box-boolean — Second-Box Boolean Preservation Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean","aliases":["89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean"],"display":"lem-glb-second-box-boolean — Second-Box Boolean Preservation Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-glb-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-glb-second-box-boolean — Second-Box Boolean Preservation Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a9efa2261b8f73c\" href=\"?note=5a9efa2261b8f73c\" title=\"89-df-glb-logic\">89-df-glb-logic</a> 的双模态定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为有限个形如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0 B\">\\(\\Box_0 B\\)</span> 的公式的布尔组合（允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top,\\bot\">\\(\\top,\\bot\\)</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}second\\text{-}box\\text{-}boolean}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\Box_1(F\\lor G)\\leftrightarrow(F\\lor\\Box_1G)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}second\\text{-}box\\text{-}boolean}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\Box_1(F\\lor G)\\leftrightarrow(F\\lor\\Box_1G)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 16 章 p.217，Lemma 6。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>第一盒 4 加单调交互给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\Box_0B\">\\(\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\Box_0B\\)</span>，负内省交互给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0B\">\\(\\neg\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0B\\)</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg F\">\\(\\neg F\\)</span> 各作有限命题范式，K 的有限合取/析取保真推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to\\Box_1F\">\\(F\\to\\Box_1F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg F\\to\\Box_1\\neg F\">\\(\\neg F\\to\\Box_1\\neg F\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>正向在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg F\">\\(\\neg F\\)</span> 条件下合并 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1\\neg F\">\\(\\Box_1\\neg F\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1(F\\lor G)\">\\(\\Box_1(F\\lor G)\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_1G\">\\(\\Box_1G\\)</span>；反向由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to\\Box_1F\">\\(F\\to\\Box_1F\\)</span> 与正规单调性。常真、常假边界由必然化处理。结论不适用于任意含第二盒的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-glb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5a9efa2261b8f73c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}$ 为 [[89-df-glb-logic]] 的双模态定理集。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_0 B","display":false},{"tex":"\\top,\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}glb\\text{-}second\\text{-}box\\text{-}boolean}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\Box_1(F\\lor G)\\leftrightarrow(F\\lor\\Box_1G)\\bigr)\\in\\mathrm{GLB}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\Box_0B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\Box_0B\\to\\Box_1\\neg\\Box_0B","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\to\\Box_1F","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg F\\to\\Box_1\\neg F","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_1\\neg F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_1(F\\lor G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_1G","display":false},{"tex":"F\\to\\Box_1F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1398,"backlinks":[{"id":"0413066aa327a245","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"正规化：[[89-df-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-glb-nice-normalization]] → [[89-lem-glb-second-box-boolean]] → [[89-lem-glb-normal-box-reduction]] → [[89-thm-glb-letterless-normal-form]] → [[89-cor-glb-letterless-truth-decision]]。算例：[[89-ex-glb-normal-form-reduction]]。"}],"outgoing":["5a9efa2261b8f73c"]}